  "details": "Given that I am in FBT, and all Tracking Controls are set to Tracking\nWhen I set the Tracking Controls of the LeftHand+RightHand+Head to Animation, and I play an animation on the Action layer\nObserved:\nI observe that then, the LeftHand is animated by the animation, and the RightHand is tracking the physical hand, and the Head is tracking the physical head,\nand the Debug menu shows that the Tracking Control of the LeftHand+RightHand+Head are set to Animation.\nExpected:\nI expected that then, the LeftHand+RightHand+Head would have been animated by the animation.",
